    m_Untranslated: "We invite you to consult the <a href=\"https://docs.unity3d.com/Packages/com.unity.render-pipelines.universal@latest/index.html\">documentation for URP.</a>\n\nYou can also get insights by watching our GDC talks:\n\u2022 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zPTNrSgoJow\">Cross-platform game development with the new URP sample scene</a>\n\u2022 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5z55_k0MgGA\">How to Build for PS VR2 with URP</a>"
